      <div class="t-display" style="color:var(--plum)">About NKEF</div>
      <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--plum)">Ballybunion North Kerry Environmental Forum (NKEF) is a voluntary environmental group founded in 2007, dedicated to community, the natural environment, and positive action on all environmental matters.</p>
      <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--plum)">NKEF works across sustainable development, climate action, circular economy, social justice, global citizenship education, ocean literacy, and the Sustainable Development Goals — putting people and planet first, thinking global and acting local. For more on our sustainability work and SDG resources, <a href="{{ site.facebook_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="text-decoration:underline;color:var(--plum)">visit our Facebook page here.</a></p>
      <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--plum)">SportsXChange is an initiative of Ballybunion NKEF. We are happy to have been awarded a Circular Communications Grant as part of Circular.ie's programme, supporting organisations across Ireland to amplify the impact of their circular economy initiatives.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px;">
        <img src="/assets/logo-nkef.png" alt="North Kerry Environmental Forum" style="height:40px;width:auto;">
        <img src="/assets/Circular_Yellow_RGB.svg" alt="Circular.ie" style="height:40px;width:auto;">
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-plum" href="/why-this-matters/" style="align-self:flex-start">Read more about why we're doing this project here →</a>
    </div>
    <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;max-width:480px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
